        "Information architecture and navigation — Although the project had a strong visual component, it was still an e-commerce with many categories and a large catalog. I worked on how information was organized and on the structure of the main pages so users could browse the store, explore collections and look at products easily. The proposal combined more editorial spaces with recognizable e-commerce structures.",
        "Consistency across screens — To keep the experience coherent I defined reusable components and visual patterns. This kept the same visual and interaction logic across the site's sections and makes it easier to add new products and collections: the design can grow with the catalog without losing the personality being built.",
